1
00:00:00,249 --> 00:00:02,579
(Sheldon:)You're a real catch compared
to some snoring guy...

2
00:00:02,751 --> 00:00:05,621
(Sheldon:)...with a fridge full of lousy grapes.

3
00:00:06,856 --> 00:00:07,876
(Leonard:)None of this matters.

4
00:00:08,057 --> 00:00:11,687
(Leonard:)I trust that Penny cares about me
and nothing's gonna happen with this guy.

5
00:00:11,861 --> 00:00:15,021
(Sheldon:)Unless of course he's a skilled hypnotist.

6
00:00:16,599 --> 00:00:17,729
(Leonard:)What?

7
00:00:18,367 --> 00:00:21,067
(Sheldon:)While unlikely,
it's still a statistical possibility.

8
00:00:21,237 --> 00:00:26,337
(Sheldon:)She might be performing sexual acts
with him and not even know it.

9
00:00:28,277 --> 00:00:30,807
- Now you're just being ridiculous.
- Am I?

10
00:00:30,980 --> 00:00:33,740
(Sheldon:)The mind's a mysterious thing, Leonard.

11
00:00:33,916 --> 00:00:35,886
(Sheldon:)He could be having the time of his life...

12
00:00:36,051 --> 00:00:38,751
(Sheldon:)...while she thinks she's a chicken
pecking for corn.

13
00:00:49,865 --> 00:00:55,865
(Raj:)Look at us, sneaking around in the middle
of the night like a couple of cat burglars.

14
00:00:56,772 --> 00:00:58,242
(Howard:)I think we're more like ninjas.

